// Q-1254 With a database per tenant, `/_quillo/ready` says the database is "down" (503) though every tenant's page works: an orchestrator's readiness probe never sends the app traffic
// mode: script
// script: steps.sh
// open-when: "database":"down"
// fixed-when: "ready":true
// From FEEDBACK79.md §Q-1254 (found by quillo-videos-36 on 238dac2, 0.8.6, in Help Desk; open on 68da426, 0.8.8).

tenant_from("localhost")
db.open("data/{tenant}.db")
route POST /teams = new_tenant("acme", () => "made")
route GET / with db = `tenant ${tenant()}: ${len(db.query("select 1 as one"))} row`
